OL,3,GNEWSAMet investigating British man's
OL,4,Adeath in Caribbean
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior coroner Lydia Brown said the
OL,7,FMetropolitan Police was now
OL,8,Finvestigating his death and that
OL,9,Finquest proceedings had been suspended
OL,10,Fpending the outcome of the
OL,11,Finvestigation.
OL,13,FFrederick's family attended West London
OL,14,FCoroner's Court via video link on
OL,15,FTuesday. It is understood there are
OL,16,Fongoing diplomatic discussions with the
OL,17,Fauthorities in Grenada.
